# foreman creates an agent's git worktree at .claude/worktrees/<name> inside
# the repo it is working on (see foreman's runner.ts worktreePath), so a plain
# `git add -A` will otherwise commit a gitlink to a throwaway worktree - which
# happened once, in 09c7e86.
.claude/worktrees/
